# Code mods built into the 3DS executable (build_mods.sh). All CC0, from the
# submodules in mods/: <repo> [<package>] (the ProxyBK repo builds one
# package at a time). They are built against this repository's bk-decomp and
# BanjoRecompSyms, not their own submodules.
ProxyBK_RecompMods ExitToLair
ProxyBK_RecompMods SkipIt
ProxyBK_RecompMods ToggleTrot
ProxyBK_RecompMods TransformAnywhere
ProxyBK_RecompMods AbilityAnywhere
ProxyBK_RecompMods Cheats
BanjoBeeMod
QuietTalonTrot
BK-Sir-Slush-Configuration
